<Layout title="Our story" description="The Afterglow Vintage point of view: clothes with character, a 90s attitude, and a new story waiting to happen." current="about/">
  <section class="page-intro section"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY / THE WAY WE SEE IT</p><h1>Some things<br /><em>stay with you.</em></h1><p class="lead">A song on a mixtape. The jacket you borrowed and never gave back. The jeans that feel like they were made for you.</p></section>
  <section class="story-grid section"><img src={url('images/editorial.webp')} width="1536" height="1024" alt="Worn denim and leather in warm afternoon light" /><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THAT'S THE AFTERGLOW.</p><h2>Clothes with a past.<br /><em>Style in the present.</em></h2><p>Afterglow Vintage is a love letter to getting dressed your own way. To faded colors, unexpected combinations, and pieces that don’t need to be perfect to be your favorite.</p><p>Our inspiration comes from the 90s: the ease, the edge, the feeling that you could make something entirely yours. But this isn’t a costume. It’s a starting point.</p><p>Wear it loose. Mix the decades. Make a little history.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('lookbook/')}>EXPLORE THE EDIT ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="principles section"><div><span class="eyebrow">01</span><h3>Character over polish.</h3><p>The faded finish. The softened fabric. The details that only time can make.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">02</span><h3>Style over a timestamp.</h3><p>Borrow from another era. Wear it in this one. The best outfits don’t follow a script.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">03</span><h3>Keep the story going.</h3><p>Give something you love a little care, a lot of wear, and a new chapter.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
